+# Corpus fetch: rate limit and hosts
+
+Not recorded.
+
+`GATE1.md` says fetching was "rate-limited" but gives no number for visits per
+window, window length, or cooldown after a breach. `manifest.tsv`'s header
+names one host: raw.githubusercontent.com (files located via GitHub code
+search on grep.app, then fetched raw from that host). No CDN or mirror host
+is named anywhere.
+
+Rather than invent the rate-limit figures, this file records the gap. If a
